1	line	Henryeta Carnillean	Oh, hello. I'm afraid I'm not very presentable at the moment. I've been under incredible stress of late! It's ruining my complexion!
1	line	Player	Why? What's wrong?
1	line	Henryeta Carnillean	It's those awful cultists! I just don't feel safe here anymore!
1	action	end
