0	section	Talking to Butler Jones
1	line	Player	Hello there.
1	line	Butler Jones	Hello, adventurer. How are you doing with your quest?
1	line	Player	Drop the act, Jones. I know you're in league with the cultists.
1	line	Butler Jones	Have you hit your head? That's a preposterous accusation!
1	line	Player	Really? So you won't mind me telling Ceril then?
1	line	Butler Jones	Oh, you think he'll take your word over mine? He trusts me completely!
1	line	Player	We'll see about that.
1	action	end
0	section	Returning the armour
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	You're back. Have you had any luck yet?
1	line	Player	Look! I've recovered your armour!
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Well done! I must say I am very impressed! Come on, hand it over.
1	box	You give the armour to Ceril.
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Before we send you on your way with your payment, I'll just get Jones to whip you up a batch of his special broth.
1	line	Player	I'd rather not if it's all the same to you. Apparently Jones is in league with the cultists.
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	What? Right! You! We're going to blooming well sort this out right now, once and for all!
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Jones! This commoner says you had something to do with the cultists that stole my armour. What do you have to say for yourself?
1	line	Butler Jones	Nothing to do with me, sir. I am, as you know, a loyal servant.
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Humph. Quite right too. I cannot fathom why this scoundrel would accuse you of such a crime without evidence to back up the accusations.
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Right, I have made a decision. I have given my word as a nobleman to reward you for your efforts in retrieving my armour, but I must also compensate Jones for this terrible slander.
1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Now take this and leave! And don't darken my doorstep again!
1	line	Butler Jones	Don't worry, sir, he won't be bothering us any more.
1	box	Jones smirks at you. You are going to need more than words to prove his treachery.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Cecil
