1	line	Ceril Carnillean	Hello again, adventurer! It's good to see you! If it wasn't for your quick thinking, the treacherous Jones would have probably poisoned my family and I by now! We are in your debt.
1	line	Player	Don't worry about it! A good deed is its own reward. And that money didn't hurt either.
1	action	end
