0	section	Talking to Alomone after obtaining the scroll
1	line	Player	Hello, Alomone.
1	line	Alomone	Have you brought the scroll of restoration?
1	action	If the player has the scroll in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Yes, I have it right here.
2	line	Alomone	At long last! With the words contained within this scroll, our lord shall finally return to us!
3	line	Alomone	Watch adventurer, and witness the glorious rebirth of Hazeel!
2	line	Alomone	Sentente sillaberi junque dithmento! Ia! Ia! Dextrimon encanto! Termando... Imcando... Solly enty rando... Sentente! Ia! Ia! Indenti zaggarati g'thxa!
2	line	Alomone	Dintenta! Sententa! Retenta! Q'exjta! Ia! Sottottott! Ia! Dysmenta junque fammatio svelken! Sottey! Sentey! Soloment!
2	line	Hazeel	My loyal followers, I have pride in you all. You have achieved a feat many would have considered impossible and returned me to this land.
2	line	Hazeel	Much time has passed and I have much to attend to, but first, I believe there is one here who deserves my gratitude.
2	line	Hazeel	Adventurer, I know that your efforts were essential in bringing about my return. You have my thanks. Know that I consider you an ally.
2	line	Hazeel	Now, I must leave you, loyal subjects, for time is short. My Mahjarrat kin will soon head northwards, and I have much to prepare.
2	line	Hazeel	Rest assured, when my work is done, I will return to you. Before long, the world will know of Hazeel once more!
1	action	If the player does not have the scroll in their inventory:
2	line	Player	Nope, sorry.
2	line	Alomone	You must find it and bring it to me! Hazeel has already waited far too long for his return.
2	action	end
